WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.280
(crunches cereal)

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:14.280
Everyone... I brought in baby wipes if you need them.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.180
Dale... I'm returning your man-shaped dildo.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.960
Hey guys... I made everybody lunch.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.960
I'm gonna be a while.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.180
They're all sheep.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.220
Turn it off.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.680
Sorry. I read through all your emails. You should really call Peggy back.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.500
She seems nice.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.820
I lost my band in there.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.180
I don't want THEM to see us like this!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:57.260
I wish you would just shut the #%*@ up.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.360
This is my happy place.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.920
He ate a blue cupcake today.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.560
Yesterday it was a pickle.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.100
Fascinating...

